  "code": "try\n    withdraw(account, 100)\ncatch e: INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS_EXCEPTION\n    write_line(\"declined: {e.message}\")\nyrt",
  "fullSource": "use IO.Std.write_line\n\nclass INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS_EXCEPTION(message: string): System.Exception is\n    super(message)\nsi\n\nwithdraw(account: int, amount: int) -> int is\n    if amount > account then\n        throw INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS_EXCEPTION(\"only {account} available\")\n    fi\n\n    return account - amount\nsi\n\nlet account = 50\ntry\n    withdraw(account, 100)\ncatch e: INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS_EXCEPTION\n    write_line(\"declined: {e.message}\")\nyrt\n",
